{"articleNo":"192493","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=192493&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[근로]2018학년도 2학기 1차 국가근로장학사업 학생신청 안내[2018.5.17.(목)~6.15.(금)]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.05.17","hit":"5045","attachments":[{"name":"1. 2018학년도 2학기 국가 교육근로 1차 학생신청 매뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=192493&attachNo=5506"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2018</span></font></span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\">학년도 2학기 국가근로장학사업 1차 학생신청 일정을 다음과 같이 알려드리니,</font></font></font></p><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\">참여를 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다. </font></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">신청일정 :</span></span></span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\" color=\"#f15f5f\"> <strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">2018.5.17.(목) 09:00 ~ 6.15.(금) 18:00시까지</strong> </font><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 신청대상 : </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">2018-2학기(학기 및&nbsp;하계방학 포함)&nbsp;국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</strong></span></font></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청장소 : <a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">한국장학재단 홈페이지(</a><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">www.kosaf.go.kr</a><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">)에서 신청</a></span></span></span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">신청방법 : 첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조</span></span></span></font></span></span></p></span></span></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5.</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"> 유의사항</span></span></span></font></span></span></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 향후 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정</span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><p><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2018-2학기 1차 또는 2차 학생신청기간에 국가근로장학사업을 신청하지 않을 경우</span></span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학기 중 근로, 하계방학 집중근로에 참여 불가 </span></span></span></span></span></span></font></p></span></span></span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\" color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span 